<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Wilsons The Leather Experts Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Wilsons The Leather Experts Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Wilsons The Leather Experts Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			WLSN.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,000,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  450,000 shrs Business: A Brooklyn Park, Minn-based specialty retailers of men's and women's leather outerwear, apparel and accessories.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: to reduce outstanding indebtedness under the company's revolving credit facility, which will be enable the company to use future cash flow from operations and other financial capital expenditures, including new stores.</p>
<p>Financial Data N/A</p>
</text>
